{"quote_id": "Q0BD233045CEC", "quote_text": "Both Romania and Moldova have found themselves frequently struck by overflying Russian drones targeting Ukraine's Black Sea ports, while Bulgaria and Romania have suffered maritime drone attacks on commercial shipping just offshore in the Black Sea.\n\nIn the case of Romania, a Nato member, fast jets have had to be scrambled to intercept incoming Russian drones and there is a profound suspicion that these incursions are not all accidental.", "source_id": "bbc", "source_name": "BBC News", "publication_date": "2026-11-23T20:48:35+00:00", "article_name": "What strike on Russian ship in Libya says about spread of Ukraine war", "article_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm894p88jzxpo", "extraction_date": "2026-11-25T22:00:24+00:00", "article_id": 11, "char_start": 3601, "char_end": 4042, "quote_sha256": "279160205dfe23cfd21bcfb515e0c1e907123468d19a5593145aa78bd4cec3e0", "article_text_sha256": "652a5e78c2fcbc1cabb0a92f03b06a65325d043fda853d5cac61452b36d8838d", "section": "escalation_risks", "speaker": "null", "speaker_role": "null", "quote_kind": "reporting", "rationale": "Details spillover risks to NATO members Romania and Bulgaria and neighbouring Moldova from Russian strikes and drone incursions.", "model": "gemini-flash-latest", "prompt_version": "extract-v1", "verification": {"found_verbatim": true, "span_round_trip": true, "sentence_snap_small": true, "min_words": true, "max_words": true, "no_boilerplate": true, "no_heading_lines": true, "no_table_symbols": true, "no_urls": true, "starts_cleanly": true, "ends_with_sentence": true, "max_paragraphs": true, "no_ellipsis_splice": true, "source_id_present": true, "source_name_present": true, "url_https": true, "url_belongs_to_source": true, "title_present": true, "publication_date_valid": true, "extraction_date_present": true, "section_known": true}}
{"quote_id": "Q1322C4F71D74", "quote_text": "The audacious and successful night-time attack in Benghazi, co-ordinated by Ukraine's SBU security agency and its armed forces, has raised the obvious question: is the Ukraine war spreading well beyond its borders?\n\nThe answer is yes, in fact, it was already spreading. But this attack, which Ukraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky called \"an exemplary operation\" will inevitably raise the stakes another notch.", "source_id": "bbc", "source_name": "BBC News", "publication_date": "2026-11-23T20:48:35+00:00", "article_name": "What strike on Russian ship in Libya says about spread of Ukraine war", "article_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm894p88jzxpo", "extraction_date": "2026-11-25T22:00:24+00:00", "article_id": 11, "char_start": 193, "char_end": 604, "quote_sha256": "cd31465b84bc503fdd14c866eb1da017e5bc83b2763b7c5b6e1bcf6af2ab114b", "article_text_sha256": "652a5e78c2fcbc1cabb0a92f03b06a65325d043fda853d5cac61452b36d8838d", "section": "escalation_risks", "speaker": "Volodymyr Zelensky", "speaker_role": "President of Ukraine", "quote_kind": "direct_quote", "rationale": "Zelensky praises a joint Ukrainian operation striking Russian targets in Libya as the conflict expands geographically.", "model": "gemini-flash-latest", "prompt_version": "extract-v1", "verification": {"found_verbatim": true, "span_round_trip": true, "sentence_snap_small": true, "min_words": true, "max_words": true, "no_boilerplate": true, "no_heading_lines": true, "no_table_symbols": true, "no_urls": true, "starts_cleanly": true, "ends_with_sentence": true, "max_paragraphs": true, "no_ellipsis_splice": true, "source_id_present": true, "source_name_present": true, "url_https": true, "url_belongs_to_source": true, "title_present": true, "publication_date_valid": true, "extraction_date_present": true, "section_known": true}}
